{"version":1,"key":"article:49","content":{"id":49,"title":"Windows 操作系统小技巧","author":"","content":[{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"设置默认字体"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先 Windows 操作系统并没有提供直接的设置项去改变全局字体，只能通过注册表来修改默认显示字体"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"方法一，点击 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Windows+R","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 搜索 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Regedit","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 以此打开注册表编辑器，然后找到以下路径："},{"type":"styled-text","color":"gray","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Fonts"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。找到以下键值并将其修改为您需要的字体："},{"type":"styled-text","color":"gray","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Microsoft JhengHei & Microsoft JhengHei UI (TrueType)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"styled-text","color":"gray","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Microsoft JhengHei Bold & Microsoft JhengHei UI Bold (TrueType)"}]},{"text":"。","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"方法二，下载相关软件，软件通过修改注册表以修改字体"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_28392393-ae8a-42d5-9500-b30e0574874c.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_28392393-ae8a-42d5-9500-b30e0574874c.png"},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_32e5db08-7b3e-438e-94b9-18999159a72d.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_32e5db08-7b3e-438e-94b9-18999159a72d.png"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://answers.microsoft.com/zh-hans/windows/forum/all/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%9B%B4%E6%94%B9windows1011/5d32977c-3e31-43d0-91a4-19704c3b552d","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如何更改Windows10/11的系统默认显示字体"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://github.com/Tatsu-syo/noMeiryoUI/releases","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"https://github.com/Tatsu-syo/noMeiryoUI/releases"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"杀死某个进程的端口"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 Windows 如何杀死占用某个端口的进程，首先使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"netstat","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 根据端口查找进程号"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"netstat -ano | findstr <端口号>","language":"shell","uuid":"bf690d33-c305-4013-9629-e59f86365ec7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"两种杀死的方式："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"numbered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"tasklist","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 查找进程号对应进程名称"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"tasklist | findstr <进程号>","language":"shell","uuid":"0d7654ff-0e1c-48a4-a672-a61f8c4586a3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"获得进程名称后进入任务管理器杀死进程"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"taskkill","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令根据进程号直接杀死进程"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"taskkill -PID <进程号> -F","language":"Shell","uuid":"1794fad2-975b-464e-ad0e-069d1e3fa3c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/wangjunjun2008/article/details/9407219","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Windows 中杀死占用某个端口的进程"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"脚本执行策略"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在运行网络上下载的 PowerShell 脚本时，会遇到【"},{"type":"formatted","text":"在此系统上禁止运行脚本","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"】的问题，要解决此问题需要了解 Windows 上的所有执行策略及其含义："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Restricted","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":": 不允许任何脚本运行，仅允许交互式命令"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"AllSigned","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":": 只运行由受信任发布者签名的脚本"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"RemoteSigned","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":": 可以运行本地脚本，但需要远程脚本有可信的签名"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Unrestricted","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":": 允许运行所有脚本，但会有安全警告"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Bypass","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":": 无任何限制，类似于禁用执行策略"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Undefined","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":": 删除当前作用域的执行策略设置，使其继承更高层次的策略"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"之所以会出现上面的提示，一般是因为当前的执行策略是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Restricted","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Get-ExecutionPolicy","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令查看当前的执行策略"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"> Get-ExecutionPolicy\nRestricted","language":"shell","uuid":"c5a34933-73d1-4621-ae3b-1a52e21cfb3f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Set-ExecutionPolicy","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 修改执行策略"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"> Set-ExecutionPolicy RemoteSigned","language":"shell","uuid":"9f28c1b8-56d8-42f4-aabc-870cfd4950c6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果遇到【"},{"type":"formatted","text":"在此系统上禁止运行脚本","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"】这个问题，通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Set-ExecutionPolicy","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 设置执行策略就行，一般设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"RemoteSigned","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就可以。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.jianshu.com/p/4eaad2163567","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"PowerShell：因为在此系统上禁止运行脚本，解决方法"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}],"tags":[],"bannerBg":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/C__Users_pc_.editor_resources_eberhard-grossgasteiger-XTZpzxFY4Z4-unsplash_2d482a26-d864-4ed0-8aa3-0da709bccddc_bb779b13-34a1-47bd-98a2-1efb943